{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id418781858"}, "name":{"label":"pmag19"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-23T06:27:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.42.0"}, "id":{"label":"14701235427"}, "title":{"label":"Down 76 lbs. Worth every penny."}, "content":{"label":"This app has done wonders for me! I started at 248 pounds and am now down to 172. I was pretty strict with my diet initially, consistently losing around 1.5–2 pounds per week. Over time, tracking my calories became second nature.\n\nCal AI makes tracking food incredibly convenient, and I think it’s well worth the subscription price. I also frequently used ChatGPT to double-check calorie and macro estimates, especially with meals that were harder to measure. The two worked really well together.\n\nI’m in the best shape I’ve been in—possibly ever! I couldn’t be happier with my progress. It’s been money well spent!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6480417616&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
