{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1004727925"}, "name":{"label":"sofisaturno"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-21T11:36:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.42.0"}, "id":{"label":"14694305786"}, "title":{"label":"Stop working"}, "content":{"label":"I paid for a full year of Cal AI and had been using it for several months without any issues. However, for the past couple of weeks, the app has barely been working. Every time I try to scan a meal, the app freezes and becomes unusable.\n\nIt’s extremely frustrating to pay for an annual subscription and suddenly not be able to use the main feature of the app. It was working perfectly before, so I’m disappointed with the recent experience. I hope the developers address this issue soon because users who pay for a subscription should be able to rely on the app to work properly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6480417616&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id41088621"}, "name":{"label":"Vinslom Bardy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-21T05:37:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.42.0"}, "id":{"label":"14693080046"}, "title":{"label":"Under Delivers"}, "content":{"label":"I am fairly certain that this app was simply “vibe coded” with Claude Code or Codex by people with no actual software development experience or expertise in nutrition science. Like so many other apps based on a single “cool gimmick”, Cal AI falls flat in UX, useful reporting and cohesion. It does exactly one thing - takes a picture of food and generates a calorie and macro estimate that’s wrong far more often than right. \n\nFull disclosure: I’m only still using the app after they practically gave it to me when I went to cancel my free trial.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6480417616&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
